    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Abdul Ghaffar has fond memories of the day his father's plaster business, Ghaffar & Sons, secured its first major project in 1974. The contract to work on AKU's School of Nursing - the first building on the Stadium Road campus in Karachi - established a bond between the University and Ghaffar & Sons that lasts to this day, over four decades later.",
